8. Children’s privacy
BikeBank is not directed at children. It is not intended for children under 13 (and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13). Where a higher age of digital consent applies (e.g. under 16 in some contexts), do not use the optional account or Strava features if you are under that age without appropriate guardian involvement as required by law.

